# Golden-test scratch output — flutter_test writes the *_masterImage /
# *_testImage / *_isolatedDiff / *_maskedDiff set here when a golden fails.
# Regenerated on every failing run; the reviewed baselines live in
# test/goldens/, which stays tracked.
**/test/failures/

